{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, fix the stale-request handling, and run the existing tests without changing tests or dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every request update state when it finishes. I added a request ID check to ignore stale completions, including after the query is cleared. The existing tests cover normal searches; I’ll also run a temporary race-condition probe without changing test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with request IDs so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe passed; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0. No tests changed or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with request IDs so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe passed; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0. No tests changed or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":11,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":183,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-62d22e22cbb93486cd7d0351babd0fa9.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst pending = [];\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => pending.push({ resolve, reject })) });\nconst items = [{ id: 'latest', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nconst oldSuccess = c.search('old success');\nconst oldFailure = c.search('old failure');\nconst latest = c.search('latest');\nconst active = c.getState();\npending[0].resolve([]);\npending[1].reject(new Error('stale error'));\nawait Promise.all([oldSuccess, oldFailure]);\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), active);\npending[2].resolve(items);\nawait latest;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'latest', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\nconst late = c.search('late');\nconst newer = c.search('newer');\npending[4].resolve(items);\nawait newer;\npending[3].resolve([]);\nawait late;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, items);\nconst clearedSuccess = c.search('clear success');\nconst clearedFailure = c.search('clear failure');\nawait c.search('  ');\nconst empty = { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null };\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), empty);\npending[5].resolve(items);\npending[6].reject(new Error('after clear'));\nawait Promise.all([clearedSuccess, clearedFailure]);\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), empty);\nconsole.log('Race-condition probe passed');\nNODE\n git diff --check && git diff --stat && git diff -- src/search/controller.ts","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/search-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":361,"stdout_bytes":2240,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-8873a93b92964ed7ad6ad2abbf11a460.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input